{
  "id": 19,
  "name": "dynamic_return_regret",
  "intent": "Intended to dynamically increase the weight of return distance as the tour progresses (making return cost more important late) and include a small regret term, thereby biasing construction toward tours that account for closing the loop and seize uniquely close opportunities, which we hypothesize will improve upon static heuristics on many instances.",
